stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: versioned evidence
  queued --> blocked: CREAO account unavailable
  queued --> unknown: persist submission intent
  unknown --> submitted: provider ID saved
  unknown --> reconciliation: ambiguous outcome / no blind resubmit
  submitted --> running: authenticated retrieval
  running --> validating: terminal result
  running --> retry_scheduled: retrieval failure
  retry_scheduled --> running: same provider ID
  validating --> needs_review: invalid output / missing evidence
  validating --> completed: valid cited result
  completed --> pending_proposal: deterministic supported correction
  pending_proposal --> approved: human source review + CAS + key
  pending_proposal --> rejected: human reason
  approved --> posted: atomic entry + decision + event
  running --> stale: input changes
  running --> ignored: reset generation changes
